{"id":"68c90097dd3c","path":"/en/university/info/relint","lang":"en","title":"International Relations and Study Abroad","description":"","section":"International Relations and Study Abroad","crumbs":[],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/relint-relint_-_learning_by_going_2024_poster_cv_en.jpg?itok=48Hwa2U5","words":207,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/relint","en":"/en/university/info/relint"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"International Relations and Study Abroad","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"kind":"image","src":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/relint-relint_-_learning_by_going_2024_poster_cv_en.jpg?itok=48Hwa2U5","alt":"Give your CV a boost","caption":""},{"kind":"image","src":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/relint-261023miu23_usi_hansession_6.jpg?itok=HhCL6DLQ","alt":"relint-261023miu23_usi_hansession_6","caption":"Il mondo in USI 2023 - HanSession"}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"The Service"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>The International Relations and Study Abroad Service of the Università della Svizzera italiana (USI) promotes and coordinates initiatives that strengthen the university’s international profile, offering opportunities for exchange, growth, and inclusion for the entire academic community.</p> <p>Its activities and projects are developed around three main pillars:</p><ul><li> <h3> Exchange </h3> <p>Through various exchange programs, the Service facilitates international experiences for students, researchers, faculty, and administrative staff, fostering academic and cultural dialogue, while also paying close attention to sustainability. USI currently has 117 active agreements with partner universities in Switzerland, across Europe, and in several non-European countries.</p> <p><a href=\"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information\">Find out more</a></p> </li> <li> <h3> Internationalisation </h3> <p>Internationalisation is an integral part of USI’s vision and is reflected in numerous initiatives and collaborations, including support for the creation and management of double degree or joint degree programs that offer integrated academic pathways with international partners, strategic partnerships with foreign institutions, participation in national and international interest groups and academic networks, promotion of intercultural competencies, presence at major sector conferences to enhance visibility and exchanges, and hosting of academic and institutional delegations.</p> <p><a href=\"/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/partnerships\">Find out more</a></p> </li> <li> <h3> Integration </h3> <p>Through initiatives such as <a href=\"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/scholars-at-risk-network\"><em>Scholars at Risk</em></a> and <a href=\"/en/university/info/relint/inclusione\"><em>InclUSIone</em></a>, the Service promotes a university committed to the values of hospitality, inclusion, and social responsibility.</p> <p><a href=\"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information\">Find out more</a></p> </li></ul>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Information"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Sections:"},{"t":"cards","items":[{"title":"Governance","href":"/it/universita/info/relint/governance","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/relint-governance.jpg?itok=prL8D8K-"},{"title":"Specific information","href":"http://usi.ch/it/universita/info/relint/informazioni-specifiche","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/relint-informazioni_specifiche.jpg?itok=Ue8nSMqG"}]}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"International Relations and Study Abroad","href":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"Governance","href":"/en/universita/info/relint/governance"},{"label":"Strategy and objectives 2025-2028","href":"/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/internationalization-strategy-goals"},{"label":"International relations commission","href":"/en/university/info/relint/commission"},{"label":"International collaborations","href":"/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/partnerships"},{"label":"Annual report","href":"/en/university/info/relint/annual-report"},{"label":"Statistical data","href":"/en/university/info/relint/exchange/figures"},{"label":"All categories","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information"},{"label":"USI students","href":"/en/university/info/relint/usi-student"},{"label":"Incoming exchanges","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-exchange-students"},{"label":"Incoming internships","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-mobility-for-internship"},{"label":"InclUSIone","href":"/en/university/info/relint/inclusione"},{"label":"ESKAS scholarship holders","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/swiss-government-excellence-scholarships"},{"label":"Scholars at Risk","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/scholars-at-risk-network"},{"label":"USI academic staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/academic-staff"},{"label":"USI staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/administrative-staff"},{"label":"Incoming academic body","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-academic-staff"},{"label":"Incoming staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-staff-mobilities"},{"label":"Visiting researchers","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/visiting-researchers"},{"label":"External organisations","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/external-organizations"},{"label":"Partner universities","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universita-partner"},{"label":"Interested universities","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universities-interested"},{"label":"Internationalisation at home - I@H","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/internationalization-at-home"},{"label":"\"Come and Go\" newsletter","href":"/en/university/info/relint/come-go-archive"},{"label":"Events","href":"/en/university/info/relint/events"},{"label":"Il mondo in USI","href":"/en/university/info/relint/il-mondo-in-usi"},{"label":"News","href":"/en/university/info/relint/news"},{"label":"Team and contacts","href":"/en/university/info/relint/team"},{"label":"2005-2025: 20 years of activity","href":"/en/university/info/relint/20-years-of-activity"}],"links":[{"label":"+41 58 666 4626","href":"tel:+41586664626"},{"label":"relint@usi.ch","href":"mailto:relint@usi.ch"},{"label":"+41 58 666 5803","href":"tel:+41586665803"}],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/relint","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:54:33.828Z"}